WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.850
<b>Tayiri    Tayiri Castle    Irityrdia-Worshiping Nation</b>

00:04.030 --> 00:08.150
<i>To think that Cuscull's wretched mages 
would defeat us so soundly.</i>

00:05.860 --> 00:08.820
<b>Reust    Tayiri Crown Prince</b>

00:08.710 --> 00:13.410
<i>I'll marshal the troops yet again 
and personally take command this time...</i>

00:16.610 --> 00:18.120
Prince Reust.

00:19.490 --> 00:21.290
Could you be...

00:21.290 --> 00:22.460
What do you want?!

00:22.720 --> 00:24.800
Accursed Witch of the Azure Moon!

00:24.210 --> 00:27.420
<b>Tris    Cuscull Mage</b>

00:24.800 --> 00:26.920
Hey, what's with that attitude?

00:26.920 --> 00:28.760
Show Lady Aeterna some respect!

00:28.760 --> 00:30.000
Shush, Tris.

00:30.000 --> 00:30.620
What?

00:30.620 --> 00:31.610
Pamyra.

00:31.610 --> 00:32.930
What? Hey!

00:32.930 --> 00:34.790
Ah, wait!

00:36.260 --> 00:39.220
Everything will end in two weeks.

00:39.220 --> 00:42.520
I'd like for you to hold off on
marching into Cuscull until then.

00:42.780 --> 00:44.430
What?

00:44.430 --> 00:45.560
What's the meaning of this?!

00:45.840 --> 00:48.250
Come down here if you want to ask me a favor!

00:48.250 --> 00:49.900
You lowly mage!

00:50.460 --> 00:52.320
Lowly mage, you say?

00:52.700 --> 00:56.240
Can't you see that stance is what's 
brought these events upon you?

00:56.550 --> 01:01.100
Mages disrupt the world of the one 
true god, Irityrdia, with their powers!

01:03.250 --> 01:07.250
Have you ever swung your sword 
down on an infant's skull?

01:07.870 --> 01:08.960
What's this now?

01:08.960 --> 01:14.030
Or burned alive a mother 
clinging to her crying child?

01:15.130 --> 01:17.870
Tayiri is the one who has tolerated these acts.

01:18.460 --> 01:21.250
None other than your very own nation.

01:23.390 --> 01:29.700
As successor to the throne, you've studied 
history and how other nations govern.

01:30.580 --> 01:32.890
Three hundred years 
have passed since the Dark Age.

01:32.890 --> 01:36.730
No other nation as fiercely 
ethnocentric as yours has survived.

01:37.070 --> 01:40.720
What you're doing is akin to 
eating away at your own innards.

01:40.720 --> 01:42.990
I'm sure you can understand that much.

01:43.360 --> 01:45.250
Lady Tinasha, we must be going.

01:45.910 --> 01:47.580
I've warned you.

01:47.580 --> 01:49.040
Give it some good thought.

01:49.360 --> 01:51.670
Wait, I'm not done talki—

03:28.180 --> 03:32.980
~ The End of the Dream ~

03:32.980 --> 03:35.360
<b>Cuscull Castle    Nation of Mages</b>

03:33.410 --> 03:35.400
The Four Great Nations joining forces?

03:35.900 --> 03:37.380
How over the top.

03:37.820 --> 03:40.240
Even though it's meaningless.

03:40.950 --> 03:41.900
There.

03:43.950 --> 03:46.630
The new map of the mainland 
will look like this.

03:47.590 --> 03:54.450
I-Is it really possible to create a spell 
that covers the entire mainland?

03:54.450 --> 03:56.060
Don't worry.

03:56.060 --> 03:57.370
We have Aeti.

03:57.940 --> 04:00.740
No matter how large or complex 
the composition of the spell,

04:00.740 --> 04:04.750
with enough magical power, 
you can construct it piece by piece.

04:05.530 --> 04:08.290
I taught you that a long time ago.

04:09.480 --> 04:12.250
You were an excellent student.
 So open-minded.

04:12.250 --> 04:15.040
Always quick to pick up on 
what you were taught.

04:15.400 --> 04:18.320
Far surpassing me...

04:18.830 --> 04:20.370
What's wrong?

04:20.370 --> 04:22.240
Did you recall something?

04:22.980 --> 04:24.690
I just can't do it.

04:25.210 --> 04:27.410
It's like I'm still in a dream.

04:27.930 --> 04:29.330
This is no dream.

04:29.750 --> 04:31.070
I know that.

04:36.420 --> 04:38.250
There's no need for any worry.

04:38.910 --> 04:42.110
I'll be the one to protect you, Aeti.

04:43.830 --> 04:46.530
About His Majesty's behavior earlier...

04:46.530 --> 04:47.530
Renart.

04:48.090 --> 04:52.040
Do you know why all the witches 
of the mainland are women?

04:52.040 --> 04:52.710
What?

04:53.100 --> 04:56.070
<b>Renart    Cuscull Mage</b>

04:53.590 --> 04:57.120
Men's bodies, magically speaking, are unstable,

04:57.120 --> 05:00.150
and have difficulties 
holding up over a long time.

05:00.640 --> 05:02.640
So you mean His Majesty...

05:02.640 --> 05:05.070
He's feeling the psychological effects.

05:05.620 --> 05:10.370
With His Majesty in this state, a spell 
composition covering the entire mainland...

05:10.370 --> 05:11.470
It's possible.

05:12.820 --> 05:14.960
If we use my magic.

05:15.410 --> 05:20.230
But if it comes to fruition, 
the mainland is sure to change drastically.

05:24.720 --> 05:28.700
They were the ones who called me here, 
so why are we not advancing?

05:28.700 --> 05:30.600
It's been six days since we came to Tayiri.

05:31.210 --> 05:35.770
Is it due to the crushing defeat 
they suffered in the Asdra Plains?

05:36.260 --> 05:38.810
We have combined forces 
from all Four Great Nations now,

05:38.810 --> 05:42.880
so I'm surprised at how cautious 
Prince Reust is being.

05:42.880 --> 05:43.570
Your Majesty!

05:44.030 --> 05:46.290
Those mass disappearance cases...

05:46.290 --> 05:48.240
The same thing's happened in Farsas!

05:48.710 --> 05:50.920
While we're stuck twiddling our thumbs here,

05:50.920 --> 05:54.730
cities in all Four Great Nations 
have been attacked.

05:57.420 --> 05:59.580
Do you think she's the one behind this?

05:59.890 --> 06:02.750
If she wasn't, that'd be 
troubling in its own right.

06:05.270 --> 06:06.610
King Oscar!

06:07.940 --> 06:09.360
It's Cecelia.

06:09.360 --> 06:11.100
Do you have a moment?

06:11.700 --> 06:13.290
Pardon my intrusion.

06:14.370 --> 06:16.020
You visit me every day.

06:16.450 --> 06:18.310
What are you after?

06:18.940 --> 06:21.090
Young king of Farsas,

06:21.090 --> 06:23.520
is there something wrong 
with wanting to see you?

06:24.910 --> 06:29.660
If you continue to be so cold, 
I have some ideas of my own.

06:29.660 --> 06:31.160
Oh? Like what?

06:31.740 --> 06:35.580
That mage woman 
who accompanied you in Farsas...

06:35.900 --> 06:39.990
She was the Witch of 
the Azure Moon, was she not?

06:41.930 --> 06:43.720
Maybe they just look very similar.

06:43.720 --> 06:46.170
I won't let you dodge me with that excuse.

06:46.550 --> 06:49.090
I saw her again.

06:49.090 --> 06:50.170
Where?

06:50.170 --> 06:51.930
I find that hard to believe.

06:54.140 --> 06:58.240
That woman visits my brother every night.

06:58.240 --> 07:00.420
The nerve of that traitor.

07:01.190 --> 07:03.540
It should almost be time tonight...

07:06.120 --> 07:08.690
Show me the way to Prince Reust's room.

07:14.210 --> 07:16.220
Dear brother, it's me.

07:17.950 --> 07:19.100
What business have you here?!

07:19.100 --> 07:21.750
Was it not Tayiri that asked me 
to slay the witch?

07:21.750 --> 07:23.210
Please wait!

07:23.210 --> 07:25.190
What are you talking about?

07:25.920 --> 07:28.590
Playing dumb will only 
put you in a worse spot.

07:32.290 --> 07:33.300
Stay away!

07:38.940 --> 07:40.210
Akashia's wielder!

07:39.430 --> 07:41.390
<b>Pamyra    Cuscull Mage</b>

07:40.210 --> 07:41.440
You deceived us!

07:43.700 --> 07:44.580
Come.

07:45.740 --> 07:46.740
Oscar.

07:48.270 --> 07:49.250
Lady Tinasha!

07:49.250 --> 07:50.190
Let's withdraw!

07:50.490 --> 07:51.360
Hurry!

07:51.640 --> 07:52.930
It won't last for long!

07:52.930 --> 07:53.660
Quickly!

07:54.010 --> 07:54.740
Tinasha!

08:08.550 --> 08:12.940
Thanks to Prince Reust, 
we sure did waste a lot of time.

08:12.940 --> 08:16.740
I'm curious what it means that the date 
she specified has passed.

08:20.470 --> 08:22.650
I went around checking all the towns.

08:22.650 --> 08:23.890
What a pain!

08:24.310 --> 08:25.930
So, what'd you find?

08:25.930 --> 08:28.070
That girl sure is diligent.

08:28.610 --> 08:30.560
It looked like everyone had disappeared,

08:30.560 --> 08:34.030
but she had just put up a defensive barrier 
so they couldn't be perceived.

08:34.330 --> 08:36.800
Everyone in town is safe, even as we speak.

08:36.800 --> 08:37.740
I see.

08:40.930 --> 08:42.830
She won't protect herself.

08:43.200 --> 08:45.490
You need to act as her shield.

08:45.490 --> 08:46.250
Sure.

08:47.810 --> 08:49.290
That's what happened.

08:49.290 --> 08:52.260
<b>Gandona General</b>

08:49.290 --> 08:52.260
<b>Cezar General</b>

08:49.760 --> 08:52.160
That's a hard story to swallow at first glance.

08:52.160 --> 08:53.010
Indeed.

08:54.910 --> 08:56.430
Well, well.

08:56.430 --> 08:58.350
It seems you're at a loss.

08:59.330 --> 09:01.520
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

09:01.940 --> 09:05.560
I am Bardalos, chief mage of Cuscull.

09:05.560 --> 09:06.460
What?!

09:06.460 --> 09:07.520
Blasted clown!

09:07.520 --> 09:08.940
What do you want?!

09:09.200 --> 09:11.700
Come now, calm yourselves.

09:11.700 --> 09:18.010
I thought you'd want to watch our mighty king 
extend his dominion over the mainland.

09:18.010 --> 09:21.620
If I may have the honor of 
guiding all of you there.

09:21.620 --> 09:23.660
Who would agree to that?!

09:23.660 --> 09:25.760
Don't get too full of yourself!

09:25.760 --> 09:26.630
I understand.

09:27.290 --> 09:28.630
Your Majesty?!

09:28.630 --> 09:29.710
Take me there.

09:29.710 --> 09:32.380
Why, I'd be happy to oblige.

09:32.380 --> 09:35.700
However, all of you will be coming along.

09:43.710 --> 09:44.890
I see.

09:45.350 --> 09:47.740
The very definition of an ambush.

09:54.780 --> 09:56.070
Lanak.

09:56.070 --> 09:57.780
Welcome...

09:57.780 --> 10:01.500
to the ruins of Tuldarr's cathedral.

10:02.950 --> 10:05.910
<b>Formerly Tuldarr    Cathedral Ruins</b>

10:04.350 --> 10:06.870
I've asked you to join us here today...

10:07.290 --> 10:09.790
because I have a proposal.

10:10.410 --> 10:14.560
Currently, the mainland is rife 
with cruel discrimination and conflict.

10:14.560 --> 10:17.220
However, let's put an end to all of it.

10:17.530 --> 10:21.400
Those who don't comply, 
no matter where they may be,

10:21.400 --> 10:23.180
will instantly receive divine punishment.

10:23.590 --> 10:26.810
I will gain the powers 
needed to carry this out.

10:27.210 --> 10:28.980
Are you trying to become a god?

10:30.660 --> 10:34.070
Now then, let me introduce you to my bride.

10:49.850 --> 10:51.790
Is something wrong, Aeti?

10:52.730 --> 10:54.650
Why are they here?

10:54.650 --> 10:56.840
I had Bardalos bring them there.

10:57.290 --> 11:02.340
I wanted everyone to witness the moments 
until the procedure is complete.

11:03.580 --> 11:04.460
I see.

11:17.030 --> 11:20.110
Silence swaying in the sea of lament.

11:20.400 --> 11:24.030
I choose the countless outstretched hands.

11:34.690 --> 11:36.180
I need an opening.

11:36.810 --> 11:38.670
I am he who defines.

11:39.000 --> 11:42.780
I command the first lake 
to be born, Compassion.

11:43.780 --> 11:45.480
Place yourself at daybreak.

11:45.480 --> 11:50.020
<i>The five magical lakes formed 
from nature's energy and magic,</i>

11:50.020 --> 11:51.540
<i>along with countless human souls.</i>

11:51.540 --> 11:55.270
I command the second lake
 to be born, Jealousy.

11:55.620 --> 11:57.250
Place yourself at morning.

11:58.190 --> 12:01.860
<i>If I can connect them again 
through a spell composition...</i>

12:02.170 --> 12:05.780
I command the third lake to be born, Denial.

12:06.070 --> 12:07.710
Place yourself at noon.

12:08.970 --> 12:13.120
<i>I can watch over the entire 
mainland from right here.</i>

12:13.120 --> 12:16.840
I command the fourth lake to be born, Longing.

12:17.270 --> 12:19.100
Place yourself at twilight.

12:19.930 --> 12:23.300
<i>I can even command the weather to my will.</i>

12:23.740 --> 12:27.550
I command the final lake to be born, Hatred.

12:27.890 --> 12:29.630
Place yourself at midnight.

12:36.270 --> 12:38.350
Not too shabby, huh?

12:38.890 --> 12:41.230
Now, let us celebrate together...

12:41.820 --> 12:44.070
the dawn of a new age.

12:52.130 --> 12:54.370
A-Aeti, what are you...

12:55.060 --> 12:55.870
Come.

13:01.040 --> 13:02.970
What is the meaning of this?!

13:02.970 --> 13:04.210
It took so long.

13:05.040 --> 13:07.370
I had searched for you all this time.

13:08.050 --> 13:11.580
When I found you, I was 
so happy I could have cried.

13:12.710 --> 13:15.350
You were truly necessary.

13:15.350 --> 13:18.020
As the one who summoned the magical lakes,

13:18.020 --> 13:21.150
you were the only one 
who knew their defined names.

13:23.380 --> 13:25.720
The souls of the citizens you killed 
four hundred years ago,

13:25.720 --> 13:28.980
who melted into and were bound 
by the magical lakes...

13:28.980 --> 13:31.380
Now I can finally free them!

13:31.380 --> 13:32.830
Aeti...

13:32.830 --> 13:36.210
Yet again, you would betray me?!

13:36.630 --> 13:37.500
Betray you?

13:39.650 --> 13:42.660
Come, let us begin your atonement.

13:43.860 --> 13:45.550
Incapacitate her!

13:45.860 --> 13:48.250
I don't care if she loses her limbs!

13:49.130 --> 13:51.780
That's the same look you had back then.

13:51.780 --> 13:53.180
Have you finally awoken?

13:53.180 --> 13:55.020
Shut your mouth, little girl!

14:04.210 --> 14:05.690
Ah, I knew it!

14:06.150 --> 14:07.410
Pamyra. Renart.

14:08.460 --> 14:09.660
Hurry up and run away.

14:10.070 --> 14:11.320
No way.

14:11.320 --> 14:12.620
I refuse.

14:12.880 --> 14:16.790
Overwriting such an immense spell 
and sublimating the magical lakes...

14:17.370 --> 14:19.230
You're the only one who could pull it off!

14:19.620 --> 14:23.050
Protecting you is our duty.

14:25.840 --> 14:26.820
Pamyra!

14:28.040 --> 14:30.130
You really <i>did</i> betray us?

14:30.130 --> 14:31.600
How amusing!

14:32.030 --> 14:33.240
Lady Tinasha!

14:37.010 --> 14:38.090
Oscar!

14:39.820 --> 14:41.780
Ask me for help already.

14:41.780 --> 14:43.230
What should I do?

14:43.980 --> 14:45.820
I just need ten minutes.

14:46.190 --> 14:47.220
Got it.

14:48.140 --> 14:50.730
The swordsman who wields Akashia?

14:50.730 --> 14:54.450
I've heard the legends, 
but how much of it is true?

14:54.760 --> 14:56.620
Dunno. Never interested me.

15:00.770 --> 15:01.580
It can't be!

15:02.190 --> 15:04.820
Lady Aeterna would never betray us!

15:09.540 --> 15:11.090
Summon the demons!

15:11.420 --> 15:12.760
Kill them!

15:27.030 --> 15:28.570
Take this!

15:30.840 --> 15:32.230
It's...

15:32.230 --> 15:34.410
It's your fault that my sister...

15:35.120 --> 15:40.280
<i>So these are the centuries of 
accumulated sins that Tayiri bears?!</i>

15:40.280 --> 15:42.830
Die! You monster—

15:47.310 --> 15:50.140
Save your contemplation for later!

15:51.180 --> 15:52.110
Yeah...

15:56.500 --> 16:00.210
Inscribed pacts woven of a voiceless voice.

16:00.650 --> 16:04.650
Hope is born in the depths of despair.

16:01.600 --> 16:03.140
A double incantation?

16:03.140 --> 16:04.650
And what's more, this is...

16:04.650 --> 16:06.340
From Tuldarr's...

16:05.080 --> 16:09.730
The flow of time is irreversible, and 
the sea that holds it forms consciousness...

16:07.060 --> 16:08.630
coronation ceremony!

16:13.290 --> 16:14.320
Aeti...

16:14.870 --> 16:16.020
It couldn't be...

16:16.740 --> 16:21.710
The spirits of Tuldarr allegedly 
summoned by their first ruler?

16:21.710 --> 16:24.580
I thought that was just a myth!

16:24.580 --> 16:28.040
Controlling multiple high-ranking 
demons is impossible!

16:28.320 --> 16:30.810
And twelve of them in all...

16:30.810 --> 16:31.460
There's no way.

16:32.190 --> 16:34.180
The end is nigh.

16:34.710 --> 16:38.350
What a shame, just when I'd come 
face to face with the mage killers.

16:38.750 --> 16:41.770
Don't worry. I'm keen to end it here, too.

16:41.770 --> 16:44.940
If you want to end it, then come at me.

16:45.430 --> 16:47.610
Go on, burn to cinders.

16:53.130 --> 16:54.150
I'm here.

17:03.410 --> 17:07.130
Though distant the day it began, 
ye be unchanging.

17:07.710 --> 17:08.490
So?

17:08.490 --> 17:10.150
What are you going to show us?

17:11.220 --> 17:12.510
Appear before me!

17:12.990 --> 17:16.930
Spirits tied to Tuldarr by ancient pact!

17:17.370 --> 17:22.180
I am Tinasha As Meyer Ur Aeterna Tuldarr!

17:22.810 --> 17:25.850
As your ruler, my declaration defines you!

17:26.500 --> 17:27.810
Come to me!

17:31.570 --> 17:33.740
<b>Twelve Spirits of Tuldarr</b>

17:37.340 --> 17:39.770
It's been a while since we emerged.

17:42.650 --> 17:43.750
I command you.

17:43.750 --> 17:45.710
Annihilate my enemies.

17:45.710 --> 17:48.120
Feel free to ignore those 
without the will to fight.

17:48.500 --> 17:50.210
If you can, don't kill them.

18:17.590 --> 18:19.260
Aeti...

18:20.070 --> 18:21.580
Aeterna...

18:29.300 --> 18:32.590
Oh, so we meet again.

18:35.400 --> 18:37.120
What do you want?

18:37.120 --> 18:38.090
Not much.

18:38.940 --> 18:40.820
I just have one question.

18:41.490 --> 18:45.810
If you want to know something, ask Aeterna.

18:45.810 --> 18:48.270
Aeti knows everything.

18:48.910 --> 18:51.410
That's why I'm met with pity.

18:52.210 --> 18:55.610
If she had been weaker, 
none of this would have...

18:56.210 --> 18:59.050
It's her fault that Tuldarr was destroyed.

18:59.050 --> 19:01.870
It's because of her that I'm...

19:02.700 --> 19:05.710
She believed in you until the very end.

19:06.490 --> 19:08.740
When you sliced her belly open...

19:08.740 --> 19:09.990
What did you feel?

19:15.110 --> 19:17.370
Nothing at all.

19:19.530 --> 19:21.760
She's nothing but a tool.

19:46.930 --> 19:48.450
King of Farsas.

19:49.140 --> 19:53.090
As the wielder of Akashia, 
you know what must be done.

20:02.250 --> 20:03.850
It's fine, you two.

20:05.500 --> 20:06.470
Thanks.

20:14.980 --> 20:19.910
When you broke Lucrezia's spell, 
do you remember what I said?

20:38.590 --> 20:39.590
Tinasha!

20:41.150 --> 20:42.220
You've come to?

20:42.910 --> 20:45.530
I didn't expect you to sleep for a full week.

20:48.370 --> 20:51.270
Why am I still alive?

20:52.780 --> 20:53.780
Whoa there.

20:54.310 --> 20:56.170
Cutting right to the chase?

20:56.170 --> 20:58.110
If you weren't recovering, 
I'd give you a noogie.

20:59.390 --> 21:03.290
In the end, Prince Reust decided 
not to initiate force on Cuscull,

21:03.290 --> 21:05.410
leaving it as an autonomous state for mages.

21:05.410 --> 21:06.060
What?

21:07.100 --> 21:09.550
Your lecturing must have gotten through to him.

21:10.330 --> 21:12.870
You... really think so?

21:13.420 --> 21:15.930
A lot happened.

21:16.620 --> 21:19.010
In the past, and the present.

21:19.740 --> 21:21.420
Even so, I'm...

21:22.170 --> 21:23.070
I see.

21:26.250 --> 21:28.470
Oh, that reminds me.

21:28.950 --> 21:32.330
You're officially my fiancée now.

21:32.330 --> 21:33.570
Why's that?!

21:33.570 --> 21:37.310
That was the only way to bring
 you back alive in that situation.

21:37.710 --> 21:39.960
There were those who wanted you dead,

21:39.960 --> 21:44.170
but a lot more of them 
wanted to use your powers.

21:44.170 --> 21:46.610
And what about what <i>I</i> think?!

21:46.940 --> 21:51.410
Well, now that it's come to this, 
work hard for the remaining half a year.

21:54.940 --> 21:58.540
As you wish, my contract holder.

22:01.010 --> 22:02.020
Thanks.

23:35.470 --> 23:39.980
~ Green Vines ~
